     1299               end.
     1300               assign
     1301                 v-set-qnty = v-fact-qnty + v-curr-qnty
     1302               .
     1303             end.
     1304             run gbl/rt-lined.p
     1305               (input  v-unique-doc-code
     1306               ,input  v-b-code
